# NOTE: the .NET template excludes **/charts here, meaning Helm charts. This
# repository has none, and it does have client/src/app/shared/charts — which
# the pattern silently removed from the build context, so the image built
# without the chart components and failed on an unresolved import.
**/docker-compose*
**/Dockerfile*
**/node_modules
**/npm-debug.log
**/obj
**/wwwroot
**/secrets.dev.yaml
**/values.dev.yaml
LICENSE
README.md

# Sync-conflict copies. iCloud and Dropbox resolve a clash by writing
# "name 2.ext" beside the original. These have broken the Docker build once by
# shadowing a real directory, and a copy of .env would not be matched by the
# rule above — so they are excluded by name here as well.
* 2
* 2.*
